\subsection{API Reference}

The following functions are available:

\begin{itemize}
\tightlist
\item
  \texttt{db\_heading} - Create headings

  \begin{itemize}
  \tightlist
  \item
    Takes level and content
  \item
    Returns LIST(duck\_block)
  \end{itemize}
\item
  \texttt{db\_paragraph} - Create paragraphs
\end{itemize}
